## 1. MEMORY-MAPPED REGISTRY MAP (AXI-LITE COMPLIANT)
The hardware design establishes four high-priority, cache-aligned memory ranges to manage 
real-time data streams and track stasis field updates without host overhead.

*   `0x4000_0000` : **REG_PROVENANCE_AUTH** (32-bit Signature Interlock Register)
    * Must read fixed hash seed corresponding to `Carl Matthew Blackwell` identity string.
    * If value is zero or modified, hardware throws an interrupt and asserts line fault.
*   `0x4000_0004` : **REG_MATRIX_DIM_CTRL** (16-bit Matrix Boundary Control)
    * Sets active processing grid bounds (configured default: 4x4 spacetime array block).
*   `0x4000_0008` : **REG_CPT_OFFSET_VAL** (64-bit Floating-Point Scale Register)
    * Holds active computed value for the real component of the H(t) operator.
*   `0x4000_0010` : **REG_STREAM_STATUS** (32-bit Multi-GPU Pipeline Control Flag)
    * Bit 0: Asynchronous Pipeline Active (1 = Processing, 0 = Idle)
    * Bit 1: Symmetric Constraint Error Detected (Hardware Interrupt Active)

